<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">iki o tsunete hashiri nukero yami o saite</font></b></font></font>

22
00:00:55,100 --> 00:01:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Stifling our breath, reaching for beyond, tearing through the dark.</font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">tatakau koto mo aishi au koto mo</font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">In fighting and in love.</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:17,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:17,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:43,750 --> 00:01:44,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is good!</font>

32
00:01:44,830 --> 00:01:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bit by bit,
I'm figuring out the timing...</font>

33
00:01:53,460 --> 00:01:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He read my movement.</font>

34
00:01:55,550 --> 00:01:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way could he do that!</font>

35
00:01:58,180 --> 00:02:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!
We were so close...!</font>

36
00:02:00,930 --> 00:02:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, can you still move?</font>

37
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course! I'm totally fine!</font>

38
00:02:07,810 --> 00:02:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's pretty much spent...
and it's no wonder.</font>

39
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu uses
a lot of Chakra.</font>

40
00:02:14,730 --> 00:02:16,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But thanks to him,
we found our way out.</font>

41
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found the way to break through!</font>

42
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! Impossible!</font>

43
00:02:24,830 --> 00:02:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was just a coincidence.</font>

44
00:02:31,790 --> 00:02:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Run!</font>

45
00:02:33,750 --> 00:02:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run out of here and
attack from the outside!</font>

46
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-All right!</font>

47
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:42,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be able to...!</font>

48
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm not going to lose!</font>

49
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

50
00:03:00,660 --> 00:03:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

51
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

52
00:03:31,810 --> 00:03:32,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That was good just now!</font>

53
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

54
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:36,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're doing it one more time!</font>

55
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:38,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

56
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's likely that there's a limit
to that guy's Chakra, too!</font>

57
00:03:46,330 --> 00:03:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To prove that,
he's little by little...</font>

58
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:56,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This won't go as you've planned.</font>

59
00:03:58,250 --> 00:03:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I'll get you!</font>

60
00:04:05,510 --> 00:04:06,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

61
00:04:15,770 --> 00:04:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! It's been a while since
I've fought in such bad conditions.</font>

62
00:04:22,110 --> 00:04:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'm worried about
Sasuke and Naruto, too...</font>

63
00:04:28,410 --> 00:04:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be calm... Think...
What will he come after?</font>

64
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

65
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

66
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too late!</font>

67
00:05:05,450 --> 00:05:12,370
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Seal</font>

68
00:05:05,450 --> 00:05:12,370
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">that has Been Released</font>

69
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was Sakura's voice!</font>

70
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did something happen?</font>

71
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that Kakashi doing?</font>

72
00:05:25,510 --> 00:05:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sa... kura... chan...</font>

73
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... I must do something...</font>

74
00:05:33,890 --> 00:05:35,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do something about it...</font>

75
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This guy...</font>

76
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go...</font>

77
00:05:43,150 --> 00:05:44,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's pointless to struggle.</font>

78
00:06:01,170 --> 00:06:02,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, behind you!!</font>

79
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:08,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

80
00:06:09,010 --> 00:06:12,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible for you
to get out of here.</font>

81
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean it.</font>

82
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:18,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you stand up, Naruto?</font>

83
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah...</font>

84
00:06:20,230 --> 00:06:22,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on,
don't waste your Chakra!</font>

85
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're playing right into his hands.</font>

86
00:06:25,740 --> 00:06:27,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

87
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

88
00:06:30,410 --> 00:06:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If things continue like this,
it's going to be really bad.</font>

89
00:06:32,910 --> 00:06:33,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

90
00:06:33,990 --> 00:06:35,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to do something.</font>

91
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strangely, my eyes have adjusted...</font>

92
00:06:41,790 --> 00:06:45,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about the time I put
an end to this for you...</font>

93
00:06:50,260 --> 00:06:51,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

94
00:06:54,390 --> 00:06:56,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand up, you idiot!</font>

95
00:06:59,310 --> 00:07:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm aiming for a vital spot...
but he's parrying all of them .</font>

96
00:07:07,990 --> 00:07:11,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...
you're so persistent!</font>

97
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:19,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A coincidence...
No, that's not it.</font>

98
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:25,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the contrary, he's fighting
while covering for his friend.</font>

99
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Surely, my movements...</font>

100
00:07:31,970 --> 00:07:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy... he can see something.</font>

101
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world...?</font>

102
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, in that case...</font>

103
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He disappeared.</font>

104
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where, where did he disappear to?!</font>

105
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:48,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Don't faint!</font>

106
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:51,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't take care of you
any more than I am now!</font>

107
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who asked you to take care of me...</font>

108
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:02,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that kid has
reached his limits.</font>

109
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsk...</font>

110
00:08:09,090 --> 00:08:12,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amazing...
That's an amazing move.</font>

111
00:08:13,550 --> 00:08:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You move well...</font>

112
00:08:15,930 --> 00:08:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

113
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'll stop you
with the next one.</font>

114
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:22,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Motor function...</font>

115
00:08:22,770 --> 00:08:26,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reflexes...
Ability to judge a situation...</font>

116
00:08:27,940 --> 00:08:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of these things...
should be at their limits!</font>

117
00:08:34,950 --> 00:08:35,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's coming!</font>

118
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down...</font>

119
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Focus!</font>

120
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...
See everything!</font>

121
00:08:59,260 --> 00:09:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He saw through absolutely everything?!</font>

122
00:09:01,890 --> 00:09:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

123
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those eyes...</font>

124
00:09:16,450 --> 00:09:17,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...</font>

125
00:09:19,950 --> 00:09:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan...</font>

126
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...</font>

127
00:09:26,750 --> 00:09:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only a little, but...</font>

128
00:09:29,340 --> 00:09:30,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was able to see!</font>

129
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you also have the power
of Kekkei Genkai...</font>

130
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a kid...</font>

131
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not perfect yet,</font>

132
00:09:42,890 --> 00:09:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to think that in the middle of a battle
he was able to rouse this power...</font>

133
00:09:48,190 --> 00:09:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case,
I can't fight him too long...</font>

134
00:09:52,940 --> 00:09:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu uses a lot of Chakra.</font>

135
00:09:55,990 --> 00:09:58,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are also limits to retaining
the teleportation speed.</font>

136
00:09:59,780 --> 00:10:03,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, the longer the fight continues,</font>

137
00:10:03,660 --> 00:10:07,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the more my movements will enter
into the range of his "reading."</font>

138
00:10:09,540 --> 00:10:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In fact, his eyes
have already captured me.</font>

139
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would be foolish to aim
straight at him.</font>

140
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...</font>

141
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll use that kid to lure him in!</font>

142
00:10:29,900 --> 00:10:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

143
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me make it in time!</font>

144
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

145
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:52,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were late entering
to guard, Kakashi.</font>

146
00:10:52,750 --> 00:10:57,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your whole-hearted intent to help
those kids has gone to your head,</font>

147
00:10:57,300 --> 00:10:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it seems to have clouded
your Sharingan</font>

148
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with even heavier fog.</font>

149
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though you have
those impressive eyes,</font>

150
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your ability to read your enemy's
movements is getting cloudy.</font>

151
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amuse me more, Kakashi...</font>

152
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:18,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to repay my debt in
an amusing way.</font>

153
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry. Anytime now,
Haku is going to defeat those kids.</font>

154
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:37,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You better apologize to them
in tears</font>

155
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you are in "the next world"
for your lack of strength.</font>

156
00:12:11,290 --> 00:12:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun will be defeated...?</font>

157
00:12:16,250 --> 00:12:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true!</font>

158
00:12:18,380 --> 00:12:19,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun is...</font>

159
00:12:19,710 --> 00:12:20,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

160
00:12:22,010 --> 00:12:23,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not by that guy!</font>

161
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:25,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

162
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He won't be defeated!</font>

163
00:12:27,970 --> 00:12:29,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

164
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto won't either!</font>

165
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

166
00:12:34,310 --> 00:12:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh!</font>

167
00:12:37,730 --> 00:12:42,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... believe in their strength.</font>

168
00:12:44,990 --> 00:12:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto is the Number One Hyperactive,
Knucklehead Ninja...</font>

169
00:12:51,250 --> 00:12:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Sasuke is a member of
the most excellent clan</font>

170
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:56,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the Hidden Leaf Village!</font>

171
00:12:57,670 --> 00:12:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That can't be!</font>

172
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:04,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...
His name is Uchiha Sasuke...</font>

173
00:13:05,510 --> 00:13:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He bears within his body...</font>

174
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the famous Kekkei Genkai
of the Uchiha clan!</font>

175
00:13:11,180 --> 00:13:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a Ninja genius.</font>

176
00:13:15,270 --> 00:13:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the remaining survivor
of that tragic clan?!</font>

177
00:13:27,780 --> 00:13:30,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wonder he grows so quickly.</font>

178
00:13:32,950 --> 00:13:33,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

179
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the same as Haku.</font>

180
00:13:38,830 --> 00:13:41,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody has ever beaten
that secret Jutsu of Haku's</font>

181
00:13:43,090 --> 00:13:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not one person in the past...</font>

182
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:49,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then...</font>

183
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:52,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time I settled this too, huh.</font>

184
00:13:52,810 --> 00:13:55,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, don't move from here.</font>

185
00:13:55,140 --> 00:13:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... ah... okay!</font>

186
00:14:04,490 --> 00:14:07,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'm going to put
an end to this!</font>

187
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For God's sake, you...</font>

188
00:14:21,170 --> 00:14:25,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just won't quit...
dragging my feet, will you?</font>

189
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it!
Sasuke...!</font>

190
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What kind of expression
is that...</font>

191
00:14:45,150 --> 00:14:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... idiot...!</font>

192
00:14:51,780 --> 00:14:53,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why?!</font>

193
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:57,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You protected me...?!</font>

194
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:03,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How the hell... should I know?</font>

195
00:15:25,110 --> 00:15:29,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...! Sasuke...! Sasuke...!</font>

196
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph...</font>

197
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

198
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hated you...</font>

199
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:47,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? Why...?</font>

200
00:15:48,170 --> 00:15:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... me...?</font>

201
00:15:57,810 --> 00:16:00,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't ask for your help!!</font>

202
00:16:04,650 --> 00:16:06,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

203
00:16:06,650 --> 00:16:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body moved... of its own accord...</font>

204
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:12,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool...!</font>

205
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

206
00:16:29,130 --> 00:16:30,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That man...</font>

207
00:16:34,010 --> 00:16:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until I defeated... my brother...</font>

208
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:42,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely refused to die...</font>

209
00:16:42,230 --> 00:16:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I decided, but...</font>

210
00:16:50,610 --> 00:16:54,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, don't die...</font>

211
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:31,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He...</font>

212
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To protect someone dear to him...</font>

213
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he would plunge in
knowing it was a trap...</font>

214
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a Shinobi worthy of respect.</font>

215
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this the first time you faced
a friend's death?</font>

216
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the way of the Shinobi...</font>

217
00:18:11,270 --> 00:18:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

218
00:18:16,740 --> 00:18:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though I...
hated you too...</font>

219
00:18:31,710 --> 00:18:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't forgive you...</font>

220
00:18:54,150 --> 00:18:56,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to kill you!</font>

221
00:19:05,410 --> 00:19:07,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this Chakra?!</font>

222
00:19:11,710 --> 00:19:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...</font>

223
00:19:14,170 --> 00:19:16,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For Chakras to be tangible like that...</font>

224
00:19:18,170 --> 00:19:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-And... what a ghastly Chakra that is...</font>

225
00:19:36,610 --> 00:19:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The wound on his hand...
It's healing instantly...</font>

226
00:19:41,950 --> 00:19:43,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This boy...</font>

227
00:19:43,950 --> 00:19:45,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who in hell is he...?</font>

228
00:19:56,210 --> 00:19:57,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it Zabuza...?</font>

229
00:19:58,710 --> 00:19:59,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

230
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This sinister Chakra was once...</font>

231
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!</font>

232
00:20:06,260 --> 00:20:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is... this Chakra?</font>

233
00:20:08,930 --> 00:20:10,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It feels foul...</font>

234
00:20:11,140 --> 00:20:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi?
No, it's too big to be Kakashi's...</font>

235
00:20:17,110 --> 00:20:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is it?</font>

236
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

237
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no...</font>

238
00:20:33,540 --> 00:20:34,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the time like this...</font>

239
00:20:35,210 --> 00:20:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The seal has broken...?</font>

240
00:20:37,420 --> 00:20:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to hurry!</font>

241
00:21:13,870 --> 00:21:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's coming!</font>

242
00:21:33,450 --> 00:21:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

