<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Sasuke's dream...</font>

264
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What about your dream?!</font>

265
00:23:08,490 --> 00:23:11,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!</font>

